  "human": {
    "label": "01 — Human",
    "heading": "Interested in what holds. And what slips through.",
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "role": "humanAside"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ],
              "text": "Technology is behind the screen. But it comes from "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                },
                {
                  "type": "interruption"
                }
              ],
              "text": "what is beyond it: the real world. Not perfect. Human."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "linkLabel": "Really about me",
    "linkHref": "/en/really-about-me"
  },
  "darkMatter": {
    "label": "02 —Dark Matter",
    "heading": "The work between the work.",
    "narrative": [
      {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "attrs": {
              "role": null
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In difficult projects, you  often miss the connection between pieces that were not supposed to be disconnected in the first place. Technology and business, decisions and consequences, formal roles and real responsibility, tasks and THE final goal."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "attrs": {
              "role": "humanAside"
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It seems like everything is ok. It's not. The system is starting to pull apart. Unless you have what I call "
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "textStyle",
                    "attrs": {
                      "textSize": "emphasis"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "bold"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "interruption"
                  }
                ],
                "text": "dark matter."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "closingThought": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "role": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "textStyle",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textSize": "emphasis"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "text": "Helping other people learn to see the whole. Clearly."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "supportingText": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "role": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The dots are connected. The picture is clear. Time to leave. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ],
              "text": "But I think they will miss Giorgino, anyway."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
